# REBASE WARNING (2026-10-20 incident): on every upstream pin bump, verify
# the rebase scratch base REALLY is the new pin before replaying — an
# ambiguous tag/branch refname plus `git archive | tar` without pipefail
# once replayed the whole series onto the OLD pin and reported a bogus
# "SERIES COMPLETE". Always md5-spot-check base files against
# `git show <pin>:<path>`, apply with STRICT git apply (no fuzz), then
# diff the merged tree against pristine upstream and confirm every
# inter-pin upstream change survives (a fuzz/forced hunk silently drops
# upstream lines inside replaced regions).
